easy_list = [
 ("Essay ka matlab hai 'koshish' - French shabd 'essai' se aaya. Montaigne ne 1580 mein apne mann ki baatein likhi, jaise koi diary mein dil khol de. Phir Francis Bacon aaya, jo dadaji ki tarah chhote-chhote gyaan bhare vaakya bolta tha. Jaise dadaji kehte hain 'padhai se aadmi pura banta hai', waise hi Bacon ne 'Of Studies' mein likha. Uske Essays teen baar chhape: 1597 mein 10, 1612 mein 38 aur 1625 mein 58. Isiliye Bacon ko English essay ka pita kehte hain.",
  "10-38-58 = 'Das ka note, Adtees ki chai, Atthawan ki thali' - 1597, 1612, 1625. Idols ke liye 'TCMT': Tribe, Cave, Market, Theatre = 'Tau Chacha Mandi Theatre'."),
 ("17vi sadi ke likhne wale bade bhaari, sajaavati vaakya likhte the, jaise shaadi ka card jismein bahut gold design ho. Thomas Browne ek doctor tha jisne 'Religio Medici' mein doctor ka dharm likha. Robert Burton ne udaasi (melancholy) par poori kitaab likh di aur apna naam rakha Democritus Junior. Izaak Walton ne machhli pakadne par baat-cheet wali kitaab likhi, The Compleat Angler. Hobbes ne kaha bina sarkar ke zindagi 'nasty, brutish and short' hoti hai.",
  "Browne = 'Bhai doctor' (Religio Medici), Burton = 'Bura mood' (Melancholy 1621), Walton = 'Waah machhli' (Angler 1653), Hobbes = 'Hukoomat chahiye' (Leviathan 1651)."),
 ("Milton sirf kavi nahi tha, usne bahut saare pamphlet bhi likhe. Usne apne gadya ko 'left hand' ka kaam kaha, matlab ulte haath ka kaam. 1643 mein sarkar ne niyam banaya ki koi bhi kitaab chhapne se pehle permission lo. Milton ko yeh bilkul pasand nahi aaya, jaise koi kahe ki WhatsApp message bhejne se pehle teacher se sign karwao. Isliye 1644 mein usne Areopagitica likha aur kaha ki achhi kitaab ko maarna 'reason' ko maarna hai.",
  "'Areopagitica 1644 = 44 ka license nahi chahiye'. Divorce tracts 1643-45: 'Milton ki shaadi bigdi to talaak par likha'."),
 ("Socho 1709-1712 ke London mein log coffee-house mein baith kar roz ek chhota akhbaar padhte the. Steele ne The Tatler shuru kiya aur naam rakha Isaac Bickerstaff. Phir Addison ke saath milkar The Spectator nikala, jismein ek chup-chaap Mr. Spectator sab dekhta hai. Uske club mein gaon ke zamindar Sir Roger de Coverley aur vyapari Sir Andrew Freeport jaise log the. Addison ka maqsad tha ki philosophy library se nikal kar chai ki mez tak pahunche.",
  "'Tatler = Teen (1709) Steele ka; Spectator = Spec lagake 1711 mein dono dekhte'. Sir Roger = gaon ka Tau (Tory), Freeport = Free trade wala seth (Whig)."),
 ("Samuel Johnson ek bada vidwaan tha jisne akele 1755 mein English ki Dictionary bana di. Usne The Rambler aur The Idler jaise periodical bhi likhe. Usne Shakespeare ko 'poet of nature' kaha aur 52 kaviyon ki jeevaniyan likhi, Lives of the Poets. Uska ek dost tha James Boswell, jo saaye ki tarah peechhe chalta aur Johnson ki har baat diary mein likh leta. Usi se bani 1791 ki Life of Johnson, jise sabse mahaan English biography maana jaata hai.",
  "'55 mein Dictionary, 65 mein Shakespeare, 75 mein Scotland, 79-81 mein Poets' - Johnson ka har 10 saal ka plan. Boswell = 'Bos ka Well-wisher', 1791."),
 ("Charles Lamb ek clerk tha jo office ke baad 'Elia' naam se pyaare, mazedaar essays likhta tha. Jaise koi chacha baithkar purani yaadein sunaye, waise hi Lamb apne bachpan aur parivaar ki baatein karta hai. 'Dream-Children' mein woh apne sapnon ke bachchon Alice aur John se baat karta hai, jo asal mein hain hi nahi. 'Roast Pig' mein China ka ek ladka Bo-bo galti se ghar jalaakar bhuna suar ka swaad dhoondh leta hai. Uski behen Mary essays mein 'Bridget Elia' bani hai.",
  "'Elia ke do dabbe: 1823 pehla, 1833 aakhri (Last Essays)'. Roast Pig = 'Ho-ti Bo-bo, ghar jala, khaana bana'."),
 ("Romantic daur mein teen gadya-lekhak chamke. Hazlitt ko akele ghoomna pasand tha - 'On Going a Journey' mein kehta hai main akela safar karna chahta hoon. Usne 'The Spirit of the Age' mein apne zamane ke bade logon ki tasveerein banayi. De Quincey ne afeem khane ki aadat par 'Confessions of an English Opium-Eater' likhi, sapnon jaisi bhasha mein. Leigh Hunt ne The Examiner akhbaar chalaya aur Prince Regent ki burai par jail gaya.",
  "Hazlitt = 'Hazrat akele Journey par', De Quincey = 'De Quincey ko de afeem' (1821-22), 'Knocking' = Macbeth ke darwaze pe thak-thak."),
 ("Carlyle Scotland ka ek gussail sant jaisa lekhak tha, jise 'Sage of Chelsea' kehte hain. Usne kaha tumhara zamana machine ka zamana ban gaya hai. 'Sartor Resartus' mein ek ajeeb German professor Teufelsdrockh kapdon ki philosophy samjhaata hai - jaise kehna ki samaj ke rules bhi kapdon ki tarah badalte hain. Usne 'On Heroes' mein kaha duniya ka itihaas bade logon ki jeevani hai. Uski French Revolution ki pehli copy Mill ki naukrani ne galti se jala di thi.",
  "Sartor ke teen padaav: 'Na - Beech - Haan' = Everlasting No, Centre of Indifference, Everlasting Yea. Heroes ke 6 roop: 'DPPPML' = Divinity, Prophet, Poet, Priest, Man of Letters, King."),
 ("Ruskin pehle kala ka critic tha - usne painter Turner ka bachav karne ke liye Modern Painters likha. Usne 'pathetic fallacy' shabd banaya: jab kavi kehta hai 'aasmaan ro raha hai', to woh apni bhavna prakriti par daal raha hai. Phir woh arthshastra ki taraf mudda aur 'Unto This Last' mein bola 'There is no wealth but life'. Gandhiji ne yeh kitaab train mein padhi aur Gujarati mein 'Sarvodaya' bana diya. Uski aatmakatha ka naam Praeterita hai.",
  "Ruskin ki ladder: 'Painters (1843) - Lamps (1849) - Stones (1851) - Unto (1860) - Sesame (1865) - Fors (1871) - Praeterita (1885)' = 'Paint, Lamp, Patthar, Paisa, Phool, Chitthi, Purani yaadein'."),
 ("Matthew Arnold ek school inspector aur kavi tha jo samaj ka 'culture doctor' banna chahta tha. Usne kaha criticism ka kaam hai duniya ki sabse achhi soch ko seekhna aur failana, bina swarth ke. 'Culture and Anarchy' mein usne samaj ko teen hisson mein baanta: Barbarians (raees), Philistines (madhyam varg) aur Populace (aam janta). Usne 'sweetness and light' Swift se udhaar liya. 'The Study of Poetry' mein usne kavita ko 'criticism of life' kaha.",
  "'BPP' = 'Bade, Paise-wale, Public' = Barbarians, Philistines, Populace. Hebraism = 'Hukm maano', Hellenism = 'Hosh se socho'."),
 ("Walter Pater kehta tha zindagi ka har pal poori chamak se jiyo, 'hard, gem-like flame' ki tarah, jaise Diwali ka diya. Uski 'The Renaissance' (1873) ne naujawaanon ko 'art for art's sake' ki taraf khincha. Is soch ko Aestheticism kehte hain - kala ka kaam sirf sundar hona hai, upadesh dena nahi. Oscar Wilde iska sabse chamakdaar chela tha, jisne kaha 'Life imitates Art'. Jail mein Wilde ne lambi chitthi likhi jo De Profundis bani.",
  "Pater = 'Patakha jaisi gem-like flame' (1873). Wilde ulta bolta hai: 'Zindagi kala ki nakal karti hai'."),
 ("Victorian England mein dharm aur vigyan ki badi behas chal rahi thi. Newman ne Oxford Movement chalaya, phir Catholic ban gaya, aur jab Kingsley ne uski imaandari par sawal uthaya to Apologia Pro Vita Sua likhi. J. S. Mill ne On Liberty mein kaha ek aadmi ki alag raay ko bhi dabana galat hai. Macaulay ne 1835 ki Minute mein India mein English shiksha ki wakalat ki. Huxley aur Arnold mein behas hui ki science badi ya literature.",
  "Newman = 'New Man' bana Catholic 1845. Mill ki 1859 = 'Liberty', 1869 = 'Ladies' (Subjection of Women). Macaulay = 'Minute 1835, ek shelf ki kahani'."),
 ("Virginia Woolf ne poocha: ladkiyan bade lekhak kyun nahi bani? Uska jawab tha - paisa aur apna ek kamra chahiye, jahan koi disturb na kare. Isliye 'A Room of One's Own' (1929) likhi, jismein Shakespeare ki kalpanik behen Judith ki dukhbhari kahani hai. Usne kaha 1910 ke aas-paas insaan ka svabhaav badal gaya. Usne Bennett jaise purane novelists ko 'materialists' kaha jo sirf bahari cheezein dikhate hain. 'Professions for Women' mein usne ghar ki 'Angel in the House' ko maar daalne ki baat ki.",
  "'Room 1929 = Rupaye + Room'. Judith = Shakespeare ki behen. 'December 1910 mein insaan badla' = 1910 = 'Unnees-Dus, sab badal-bas'."),
 ("George Orwell ka asli naam Eric Blair tha aur woh Bihar ke Motihari mein paida hua tha. Burma mein police officer banke usne angrezi raaj ki sachchai dekhi aur 'Shooting an Elephant' likha. 'Politics and the English Language' mein usne kaha seedhi, saaf bhasha likho, lambe shabd mat bharo. Bertrand Russell ek bada philosopher tha jise 1950 mein Literature ka Nobel mila. Usne kaha uski zindagi teen junoon par chali: pyaar, gyaan aur dukhiyon ke liye dard.",
  "Orwell ke 6 rules ko 'Chhota likho, kaato, active bolo' yaad rakho. Russell ke 3 passions = 'Pyaar, Padhai, Peeda'."),
 ("Gandhiji ne 1909 mein jahaz par baithkar 'Hind Swaraj' likhi - ek Reader aur Editor ki baat-cheet, jismein modern civilisation ki aalochana hai. Unki aatmakatha 'Satya ke Prayog' Gujarati mein likhi gayi aur Mahadev Desai ne English mein laaye. Nehru ne jail mein baithkar beti Indira ko chitthiyan likhi aur 'The Discovery of India' likhi. Ambedkar ne 1936 mein 'Annihilation of Caste' likha - ek bhashan jo kabhi diya hi nahi gaya. Unhone kaha jaati ek deewar nahi, mann ki soch hai.",
  "'Gandhi 09, Nehru 46, Ambedkar 36' = 'Gaadi 9 baje, Netaji 46 mein azaad, Ambedkar 36 mein bhashan'. Hind Swaraj = Kildonan Castle jahaz."),
 ("Tagore ne sirf Gitanjali nahi, English mein bhaashan aur nibandh bhi likhe. 'Nationalism' (1917) mein unhone kaha Western nation-state ek machine ki tarah insaaniyat ko kuchal deti hai. Amartya Sen ne 'The Argumentative Indian' mein bataya ki Bharat mein behas karne ki purani parampara hai. Nirad C. Chaudhuri ne apni aatmakatha British Empire ki yaad ko samarpit kar di. Dalit lekhakon jaise Bama aur Omprakash Valmiki ne apni peeda ki sachchi kahaniyan likhi.",
  "Tagore = '1917 Nationalism, 1941 Crisis'. Sen = 'Sen saab behas karte' (Argumentative 2005). Joothan = Hindi 1997, Karukku = Tamil 1992."),
 ("Biography matlab kisi aur ki zindagi likhna, autobiography matlab apni khud ki. Boswell ne Johnson ki zindagi aise likhi jaise koi best friend sab raaz jaanta ho. 1918 mein Lytton Strachey ne 'Eminent Victorians' mein bade logon ka mazaak udaya, ise 'new biography' kaha gaya. Diary mein log roz ki baatein likhte hain - Samuel Pepys ne 1660-69 ki diary code bhasha mein likhi. Saint ki jeevani ko hagiography kehte hain.",
  "'Bio = doosre ki, Auto = apni, Diary = roz ki'. Pepys = 'Peeps' karke chupke se shorthand mein likhta tha (1825 mein chhapi)."),
 ("Travel writing yaani safar ki kahani, jaise koi Goa trip se aakar sabko vlog dikhaye. Purani 'Travels of Sir John Mandeville' mein aadhi baatein kalpanik thi. Kinglake ne 'Eothen' mein Turkey-Middle East ki yatra likhi aur Naipaul ne India par 'An Area of Darkness' likhi. Saath hi 19vi sadi mein magazines ka zamana tha: Edinburgh Review, Quarterly Review, Blackwood's. Inhi patrikaon mein Lamb, Hazlitt aur De Quincey chhape aur inhone Keats jaise kaviyon ki burai bhi ki.",
  "Review ka order: 'Edinburgh 1802, Quarterly 1809, Blackwood's 1817, London 1820' = 'E-Q-B-L = Eat Quick Bread Loaf'.")
]
